ROOT CAUSE HISTORY: On 2026-06-30, HMS showed hotel room data because nginx
proxied /api to 8091 (Miracle OS worker). HMS backend was crashing because it
also tried to bind 8091. Fix: HMS moved to 8095, nginx updated.

DATABASE OWNERSHIP:
  Miracle OS:  miracle_os_master.db    (hotel/hospitality data)
  Miracle HMS: miracle_hms_master.db   (hospital ward/bed data — WARD/ICU/CABIN/ER/OT)
  Miracle POS: pos_master.db           (retail transaction data)
NEVER let these databases cross-contaminate. Each backend reads its own DB only.
